<title>POLAND: Mostostal-Z Q4 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-Z Q4 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			4.22  vs    1.16</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  4.20  vs    0.99</p>
<p>    net profit				2.22  vs    0.77</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				59.73  vs   44.35</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 51.94  vs   39.41</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.01  vs    0.17</p>
