<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   23.54  vs   12.64</p>
<p>    financial costs			22.23  vs   11.57</p>
<p>    investment				3.68  vs    2.40</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
